    "title": "$500 - $1,000 cash rewards offered for Abilene's Wanted Criminals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shelly Womack ,\n7 hours ago\nABILENE, Texas ( KTAB/KRBC ) – Cash rewards are being offered for information leading to the arrest of ten suspects wanted for various crimes in Abilene.\nPolice are seeking these suspects for the following offenses:\nJohn Averie Mack (FEATURED FUGITIVE) – Sexual Assault of a Child x5 JaMichael Williams – Deadly Conduct Jason James Suggs – Assault Family Violence, Sexual Assault of a Child under 14 Francisco Aguilar – Burglary of Habitation, Theft Eve Marie Ortega – Burglary of Habitation, Theft Sebastian Tolentino – Injury to a Child Andrem Lamar Tolbert – Unlawful Carrying of a Weapon Amy Renee Warren – Assault Family Violence Jessica Lee Ann Rangel – Arson Casey Jordan Chapman – Deadly Conduct, Cruelty to Animals John Mack Casey Jordan Chapman Jessica Lee Ann Rangel Amy Renee Warren Andrem Lamar Tolbert Sebastian Tolentino Eve Marie Ortega Francisco Aguilar Jason James Suggs JaMichael Williams CrimeStoppers is offering $500 cash rewards for information that leads to the capture of any of the suspects, and a $1000 cash reward for information that leads to the capture of the featured fugitive.\nCash rewards will only be given if the information is received during the week their mugshots are aired on “Abilene’s Wanted Criminals.”\n“Abilene’s Wanted Criminals” is a police-run social media segment that will highlight wanted suspects from around the City each week.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTAB - BigCountryHomepage.com.\n2",
